{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "a88410a0437941176a43f2bf69410a27a140e7a63c6c2f451af93551f54e516e", "ja": "ということで、始まりました！　こんにちは、\n『閃光☆HANABI団』の高山紗代子です。", "zh": "所以，节目开始了！大家好，\n我是『闪光☆HANABI团』的高山纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "d47ce81efa42d56004dcd32482b41232bc46cfc2aae442638647404f8e3e2c39", "ja": "この番組は、私たち閃光☆HANABI団について\n知ってもらうという主旨のもと、新たに……。", "zh": "这档节目旨在让大家了解我们“闪光☆HANABI团”，接下来将……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "3bf36a9e1ba8dc542424d4a0cff207cd3335c158405c3129e942d54d6c74196f", "ja": "3、2、1……\nさよちん、持ち時間終わりだよ！", "zh": "3、2、1……\n纱代亲，时间到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "93a450aa6f32c2fbce3e6e1f60ff3ba6ef1c9cb04a33c006f4fb13a959438d8d", "ja": "えっ、もう！？\n10秒って早いなぁ……。", "zh": "诶，已经结束了！？\n10秒过得真快啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "b467e906fffe30de1054478293bea52e01318074a53b4404898e53210a824e83", "ja": "次は私だね！　画面の向こうのみんな、元気ーっ！？\n閃光☆HANABI団の、高坂海美です☆", "zh": "接下来轮到我啦！屏幕对面的大家，精神吗——！？\n我是闪光☆HANABI团的高坂海美☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "16e31c5ad8489a2e24aec11893ac582514da94799a434b9395b3d7fc842d4d0c", "ja": "はい、次！　みなちん、どうぞ！", "zh": "好，下一个！美奈亲，请吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "f7f1b6801cf21f115992a762ce5dcc020f65e106bbfffd615efdcfea6edf3b4e", "ja": "ええっ、いきなり！？　あっ、みなさん\nこんにちは、閃光☆HANABI団の佐竹美奈子です。", "zh": "诶诶，突然就来！？啊，大家好，\n我是闪光☆HANABI团的佐竹美奈子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "c47c8d21b4a51bfe9e00e57a78919817eda49ae7e480dd4eb2b4c4ad015116c7", "ja": "生配信って、なんだか緊張するなぁ……えっと、\n初めてのチャレンジですけど、がんばります♪", "zh": "直播什么的，总觉得有点紧张呢……那个，\n虽然是第一次挑战，但我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "7c16af76ef211f28c84f6b0e55a4f15baf4568a7c4b750c2cead9ac3624c6019", "ja": "今日は私たち閃光☆HANABI団の3人で、新たな\n番組をお届けします！　どうか楽しんでくださいね！", "zh": "今天，我们闪光☆HANABI团的3位成员将为大家带来全新的节目！还请大家尽情享受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "0600826c45daa7f1ad8aac72bf2b229c78eb5bc1d9ccb3d3dc3cde871c8aa5a6", "ja": "あれ？　さよちん、なおーとのりさんは？\n閃光☆HANABI団は、5人なのに……。", "zh": "哎？纱代酱、奈绪和典子呢？\n闪光☆HANABI团明明有5个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "1f71b4baa970e3b4284a5ff892fcf1cbe84b995972d14d9438701e50efceadab", "ja": "なんて、配信を見てるみんなも、\n気になってるよね！　そうだよねっ！？", "zh": "我想，正在看直播的大家也都很在意吧！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "69e622339026301e7ee3ff63db8d731cb0b412f85a9ea1a339245b5c3dfb07c2", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんとのり子ちゃんは……この後のお楽しみ♪\n配信を見ているみなさんも、待っていてくださいね！", "zh": "奈绪和法子就留到……稍后的压轴环节♪\n正在看直播的各位，也请敬请期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "e2e5a750f157cd04f7c2de646703d830b9c389bd7aa8806df134fdc54c3dba02", "ja": "でも、この配信を見ている人たちの中には、\n閃光☆HANABI団をよく知らない人もいますよね？", "zh": "不过，看这场直播的人当中，也有不太了解闪光☆HANABI团的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "72981973610a2696922ec37b020ac117c5dcf28623db87536014cfc20ca40205", "ja": "そこで、私たちのことを知ってもらうには……\nあのドラマを見てもらうのがいいかな？　海美ちゃん！", "zh": "所以，要让大家了解我们……让大家看看那部电视剧是不是比较好？海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "4b64a888e211e699d0cbe71ea49192acde6ed044aca56a5bd5ff11dd0c33da1f", "ja": "うんうんっ！\n私も、みんなに見てほしいな☆", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n我也想让大家看看呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "aee304ab1a1928662d0bd5de78552503e3068579b6238205b37ad6a007276b85", "ja": "それでは、すこしだけお見せしちゃいますね！\nと、その前に……紗代子ちゃん、タイトルコールだよ！", "zh": "那么，就稍微给大家展示一下吧！\n不过在那之前……纱代子，来报幕啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_01_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "37e0e914fc44eaa3985632d889e7cb42d2082da35f705ed6eec9a26f11a48407", "ja": "はい、美奈子さん！　それでは、\n『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』……", "zh": "好的，美奈子！那么——\n《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
